'''Norn''' (ノルン ''Norun'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Norn
|image = E 091.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 550¢ - 2172¢
}}

==Enemy==
With low health and even lower attack power, this enemy is not much of a threat. His range makes it so almost anything can be used against him, so Norn is typically just used as a peon for more powerful Merc Storia enemies.

